     1                                  ; COMBINE (night combination coordinator, 2026-10-04, base rev0): KPHL = KP + h34 (B099 KPH_B) + locpatA (B092 KL_A). A = KL_A unchanged; B = B099 KPH_B.
     2                                  ; Good_Test V6 is friend-provided code; V6nohunt and all night edits by agent2 roles (see FINDINGS.md).
     3                                  bits 16
     4                                  
     5                                  ; B092 KL (warrior A): A031 K (E1 INT86 decoy block + A022 SD template edits) combined with the
     6                                  ; domain-2 defense A038 locpatA (B082 location start DI = 15*[1243h] + A038 window F2 81 C3 E1 -> FF 26 17 4A).
     7                                  ; Provenance: Good_Test V6 warrior 1 is friend-provided code (reconstructed source in
     8                                  ; study-notes/good-test-v6/source/); V6nohunt = agent2 edit (removed [7A00h] patch); E1/SD/locA2/locpatA are
     9                                  ; agent2 night edits (A031, A022, B082, A038); this merge = agent2 night role B092.
    10                                  ; Turn budget: locpatA startup (INT87 at instr 11) + E1 block (4 instr) + band math with a memory divisor
    11                                  ; (div/mul word [kq] instead of mov cx,3C00h; div cx; mul cx: same AX, one instruction fewer) + add si;
    12                                  ; phoenix_init still starts at turn 22 (as in rev0, K and locpatA). Data moved to the end (no jmp needed).
    13                                  ; B = A031 K_B (A026 Z1 + SD) unchanged.
